,\n        \"name\": \"Estancia Diurna\",\n        \"description\": \"Guarderia canina diurna de 8h a 20h. Comida, fotos y vídeos incluidos.\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"name\": \"Bono Semanal\",\n        \"description\": \"5 días a elección, horario flexible, comida y fotos y vídeos incluidos.\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"name\": \"Bono Mensual\",\n        \"description\": \"Días adaptados a la rutina del cliente. Precio especial para clientes habituales, comida y fotos incluidas.\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n</script>\n\n<!-- FAQ Schema — aparece en \"Preguntas frecuentes\" de Google -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿Cuánto cuesta la guarderia canina en La Casita de Simba?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Ofrecemos estancia diurna (8h a 20h), estancia por horas, bonos semanales y mensuales, y packs de cumpleaños — todo con comida, fotos y vídeos incluidos. Los precios son a consultar: escríbenos por WhatsApp y te damos tu tarifa personalizada en menos de 24 horas.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿La Casita de Simba tiene jaulas?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No. La Casita de Simba es una guarderia canina sin jaulas. Los perros tienen libertad total para moverse, jugar y descansar en un ambiente familiar y sin estrés.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿Dónde está La Casita de Simba en Madrid?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"La Casita de Simba está en Calle Puentelarra 5, Local 10, Madrid. Puedes contactar por WhatsApp al +34 613 753 680 o por email a lacasitadesimba04@gmail.com.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿Hacéis recogida a domicilio del perro?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Sí, La Casita de Simba ofrece servicio de recogida y entrega a domicilio para que no tengas que desplazarte. Consúltanos disponibilidad y zona.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿Cuál es el horario de La Casita de Simba?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"El horario es de lunes a viernes de 08:00 a 20:00. Para fines de semana consultar disponibilidad por WhatsApp.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿Mandan fotos del perro durante el día?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Sí, enviamos fotos y vídeos de tu perro por WhatsApp durante todo el día para que estés tranquilo y veas lo bien que lo pasa tu peludo.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿Cómo puedo reservar plaza en La Casita de Simba?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Puedes reservar plaza rellenando el formulario de contacto en la web, enviando un WhatsApp al +34 613 753 680 o escribiendo a lacasitadesimba04@gmail.com. Confirmamos disponibilidad en menos de 24 horas.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"¿Tenéis bonos semanales o mensuales?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Sí, ofrecemos bonos semanales y mensuales completamente adaptados a tu rutina. Los precios son a consultar — escríbenos por WhatsApp y diseñamos el bono perfecto para ti.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Pacifico&family=Dancing+Script:wght@700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root {\n  --rosa:       #F08A7C;\n  --rosa-light: #FFF0EE;\n  --rosa-dark:  #D9695B;\n  --verde:      #7EC8A4;\n  --verde-light:#EFF7F2;\n  --verde-dark: #5AA882;\n  --oscuro:     #2C3E50;\n  --gris:       #F7F7F7;\n  --texto:      #3D3D3D;\n  --blanco:     #FFFFFF;\n  --sombra:     0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);\n  --sombra-hover: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);\n  --radio:      20px;\n}\n\n* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\nhtml { scroll-behavior:smooth; }\nbody {\n  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;\n  color:var(--texto);\n  line-height:1.7;\n  overflow-x:hidden;\n  background:#fff;\n}\n\n/* ── HEADER ── */\nheader {\n  position:fixed; top:0; width:100%; z-index:1000;\n  background:transparent;\n  transition:background .4s, box-shadow .4s;\n}\nheader.scrolled {\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.96);\n  backdrop-filter:blur(20px);\n  box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,138,124,0.12);\n}\nheader.scrolled .logo { color:var(--rosa-dark); }\nheader.scrolled .logo span { color:var(--verde-dark); }\nheader.scrolled nav a { color:var(--texto); }\nheader.scrolled nav.open a { color:white !important; text-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.7) !important; }\nheader.scrolled .nav-cta { color:white !important; }\n.header-inner {\n  max-width:1200px; margin:auto;\n  padding:.9rem 2rem;\n  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\n}\n.logo {\n  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem;\n  text-decoration:none;\n  font-family:'Pacifico',cursive;\n  font-size:1.5rem;\n  color:white;\n  line-height:1;\n  transition:color .4s;\n}\n.logo span { color:rgba(255,255,255,.85); transition:color .4s; }\nnav { display:flex; gap:2rem; align-items:center; }\nnav a {\n  text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; font-size:.95rem;\n  color:rgba(255,255,255,.9); position:relative; padding-bottom:3px;\n  transition:color .2s;\n}\nnav a::after {\n  content:''; position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0;\n  width:0; height:2px; background:var(--rosa);\n  transition:width .3s;\n}\nnav a:hover { color:var(--rosa-dark); }\nnav a:hover::after { width:100%; }\n.nav-cta {\n  background:var(--rosa); color:white !important;\n  padding:.55rem 1.4rem; border-radius:50px;\n  font-weight:800 !important; transition:background .2s, transform .2s !important;\n}\n.nav-cta::after { display:none !important; }\n.nav-cta:hover { background:var(--rosa-dark) !important; transform:translateY(-2px); }\n.menu-btn {\n  display:none; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer;\n  font-size:1.6rem; color:var(--rosa-dark);\n}\n\n/* ── HERO ── */\n.hero {\n  position:relative; min-height:100vh;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  text-align:center; color:white; overflow:hidden;\n}\n\n/* Slideshow */\n.hero-slides {\n  position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0;\n}\n.hero-slide {\n  position:absolute; inset:0;\n  background-size:cover; background-position:center 20%;\n  opacity:0;\n  transition:opacity 1.6s ease-in-out;\n  transform:scale(1.08);\n}\n.hero-slide.active {\n  opacity:1;\n  animation:kenBurns 5s ease-out forwards;\n}\n@keyframes kenBurns {\n  from { transform:scale(1.08); }\n  to   { transform:scale(1); }\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1;\n  background:\n    linear-gradient(to bottom,\n      rgba(12,12,20,.82) 0%,\n      rgba(12,12,20,.55) 45%,\n      rgba(180,70,58,.65) 100%),\n    linear-gradient(to right,\n      rgba(30,50,40,.4) 0%,\n      transparent 65%);\n}\n\n/* ── PATAS FLOTANTES ── */\n.patas-wrap {\n  position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:2; pointer-events:none; overflow:hidden;\n}\n.pata {\n  position:absolute;\n  font-size:1.8rem;\n  opacity:0;\n  animation:floatPata linear infinite;\n  filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3));\n}\n@keyframes floatPata {\n  0%   { opacity:0; transform:translateY(0) rotate(var(--rot)) scale(.7); }\n  15%  { opacity:.35; }\n  80%  { opacity:.2; }\n  100% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(calc(var(--rot) + 40deg)) scale(1.1); }\n}\n\n/* ── ANIMACIONES DE ENTRADA ── */\n.hero-pill   { animation:fadeUp .7s .1s both; }\n.hero h1     { animation:fadeUp .8s .3s both; }\n.hero-sub    { animation:fadeUp .7s .55s both; }\n.hero-desc   { animation:fadeUp .7s .75s both; }\n.hero-btns   { animation:fadeUp .7s .95s both; }\n@keyframes fadeUp {\n  from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(28px); }\n  to   { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }\n}\n\n/* ── FLECHA SCROLL ── */\n.scroll-arrow {\n  position:absolute; bottom:6rem; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);\n  z-index:5; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:.3rem;\n  color:rgba(255,255,255,.7); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:700;\n  letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase;\n  animation:fadeUp .7s 1.3s both;\n  cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none;\n}\n.scroll-arrow .chevron {\n  display:block; width:22px; height:22px;\n  border-right:2.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);\n  border-bottom:2.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);\n  transform:rotate(45deg);\n  animation:bounce 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n.scroll-arrow .chevron:nth-child(2) { animation-delay:.18s; margin-top:-12px; }\n@keyframes bounce {\n  0%,100% { opacity:.3; transform:rotate(45deg) translate(-3px,-3px); }\n  50%      { opacity:1;  transform:rotate(45deg) translate(3px,3px); }\n}\n.hero-content {\n  position:relative; z-index:2;\n  max-width:860px; padding:2rem 1.5rem;\n  margin:0 auto; text-align:center;\n  display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\n}\n.hero-pill {\n  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem;\n  padding:.5rem 1.4rem; border-radius:50px;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\n  font-size:.9rem; font-weight:700;\n  margin-bottom:.8rem; letter-spacing:.04em;\n}\n.hero h1 {\n  font-family:'Pacifico',cursive;\n  font-size:clamp(3.2rem,8.5vw,6.2rem);\n  line-height:1.15; margin-bottom:.6rem;\n  text-shadow:0 4px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.55), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.4);\n  letter-spacing:.01em;\n}\n.hero-guarderia-badge {\n  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--verde-dark), var(--verde));\n  color:white; font-size:.78rem; font-weight:800;\n  letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase;\n  padding:.35rem 1.2rem; border-radius:4px;\n  margin:.5rem 0 1rem;\n}\n.hero-tagline {\n  font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:800;\n  letter-spacing:.02em; margin-bottom:.5rem;\n}\n.hero-sub {\n  font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,1.65rem);\n  font-weight:700; margin-bottom:1rem; opacity:.95;\n}\n.hero-desc {\n  font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2.4vw,1.35rem);\n  max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 1.4rem;\n  opacity:.9; line-height:1.8;\n}\n.hero-btns { display:flex; gap:1rem; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n.btn {\n  display:inline-block; text-decoration:none;\n  padding:.85rem 2.2rem; border-radius:50px;\n  font-weight:800; font-size:1rem;\n  position:relative; overflow:hidden;\n  transition:background .3s, transform .35s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), box-shadow .3s, color .3s;\n}\n.btn-rosa {\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rosa), var(--rosa-dark));\n  color:white;\n  box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(240,138,124,.45);\n}\n/* Shimmer sweep on hover */\n.btn-rosa::before {\n  content:'';\n  position:absolute; top:0; left:-80%;\n  width:55%; height:100%;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.32), transparent);\n  transform:skewX(-18deg);\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.btn-rosa:hover { background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rosa-dark), #c05040); transform:translateY(-5px); box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(240,138,124,.6); }\n.btn-rosa:hover::before { left:140%; transition:left .55s ease; }\n.btn-outline {\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);\n  border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.75);\n  color:white; backdrop-filter:blur(8px);\n}\n.btn-outline:hover { background:white; color:var(--oscuro); transform:translateY(-4px); }\n.hero-stats {\n  display:flex; gap:2rem; justify-content:center;\n  margin-top:1.2rem; flex-wrap:wrap;\n}\n.stat {\n  text-align:center;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);\n  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\n  padding:.8rem 1.5rem; border-radius:14px;\n  min-width:100px;\n}\n.stat-num { display:block; font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:900; }\n.stat-txt { font-size:.72rem; font-weight:700; opacity:.85; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n\n/* ── SECCIONES GENERALES ── */\nsection { padding:5.5rem 0; }\n.container { max-width:1200px; margin:auto; padding:0 2rem; }\n.section-label {\n  display:inline-block;\n  padding:.3rem 1rem; border-radius:50px;\n  font-size:.8rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;\n  margin-bottom:.8rem;\n}\n.label-rosa { background:var(--rosa-light); color:var(--rosa-dark); }\n.label-verde { background:var(--verde-light); color:var(--verde-dark); }\nh2 {\n  font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.8rem);\n  color:var(--oscuro); line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:.8rem;\n}\n.section-desc {\n  font-size:1.05rem; color:#666; max-width:560px;\n  margin:0 auto 3rem; text-align:center;\n}\n\n/* ── SOBRE SIMBA ── */\n.sobre-bg {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1f14 0%, #12192e 40%, #1a0d20 70%, #0d1f14 100%);\n  background-size: 300% 300%;\n  animation: sobreGradient 14s ease infinite;\n  position:relative; overflow:hidden;\n}\n@keyframes sobreGradient {\n  0%   { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n  50%  { background-position: 100% 50%; }\n  100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n}\n.sobre-bg::before {\n  content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 80%, rgba(126,200,164,.22) 0%, transparent 50%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 15%, rgba(240,138,124,.18) 0%, transparent 45%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 55% 55%, rgba(90,168,130,.10) 0%, transparent 55%);\n  animation: sobreBlobs 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n.sobre-bg::after {\n  content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 90%, rgba(240,138,124,.10) 0%, transparent 45%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 10%, rgba(126,200,164,.12) 0%, transparent 50%);\n  animation: sobreBlobs 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse;\n}\n@keyframes sobreBlobs {\n  from { transform: scale(1) translate(0, 0); opacity:.7; }\n  to   { transform: scale(1.12) translate(2%, 2%); opacity:1; }\n}\n.sobre-grid {\n  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n  gap:4rem; align-items:center; position:relative; z-index:1;\n}\n.sobre-img {\n  border-radius:28px; overflow:hidden;\n  aspect-ratio:4/5; background:#eee;\n  box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06);\n  position:relative;\n}\n.sobre-img::after {\n  content:''; position:absolute; inset:0;\n  border-radius:28px;\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.sobre-img img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }\n.sobre-texto h2 { text-align:left; color:white; }\n.sobre-texto .section-label { background:rgba(240,138,124,.2); color:var(--rosa); border:1px solid rgba(240,138,124,.3); }\n.sobre-texto p { margin-bottom:1.2rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size:1.05rem; }\n.sobre-texto strong { color:white; }\n.checks { list-style:none; margin-top:1.5rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.8rem; }\n.checks li {\n  display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:.8rem;\n  font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n  padding:.7rem 1rem; border-radius:12px;\n  backdrop-filter:blur(4px);\n  transition:background .2s, transform .2s;\n}\n.checks li:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.09); transform:translateX(4px); }\n.check-icon {\n  width:26px; height:26px; min-width:26px;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--verde-dark), var(--verde));\n  border-radius:50%;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  color:white; font-size:.8rem;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(126,200,164,.4);\n}\n\n/* ── SERVICIOS ── */\n.servicios-grid {\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));\n  gap:1.5rem;\n}\n.servicio-card {\n  background:white; border-radius:var(--radio);\n  padding:2.5rem 2rem; text-align:center;\n  box-shadow:var(--sombra);\n  border-top:5px solid transparent;\n  transition:transform .35s, box-shadow .35s;\n}\n.servicio-card:hover { transform:translateY(-10px) scale(1.02); box-shadow:var(--sombra-hover); }\n.servicio-card.rosa { border-top-color:var(--rosa); }\n.servicio-card.rosa:hover { box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(240,138,124,.22); }\n.servicio-card.verde { border-top-color:var(--verde); }\n.servicio-card.verde:hover { box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(126,200,164,.22); }\n.servicio-icon {\n  width:72px; height:72px; border-radius:50%;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  font-size:2rem; margin:0 auto 1.3rem;\n}\n.servicio-card.rosa .servicio-icon { background:var(--rosa-light); }\n.servicio-card.verde .servicio-icon { background:var(--verde-light); }\n.servicio-card h3 { font-size:1.25rem; color:var(--oscuro); margin-bottom:.7rem; }\n.servicio-card p { font-size:.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; }\n.servicio-rutina {\n  margin-top:2rem; text-align:center;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--rosa-light),var(--verde-light));\n  border-radius:var(--radio); padding:1.2rem 2rem;\n  font-size:1rem; color:var(--oscuro); line-height:1.6;\n}\n/* ── TARIFA ESTÁNDAR ── */\n.tarifa-std {\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(253,236,234,.5),rgba(230,247,238,.5));\n  border:1px solid rgba(240,138,124,.15);\n  border-radius:var(--radio); padding:2rem; margin-bottom:2.5rem;\n}\n.tarifa-std-ttl { font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--oscuro); margin-bottom:1.2rem; }\n.tarifa-tabla { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; }\n.tarifa-tabla th {\n  text-align:left; font-size:.72rem; text-transform:uppercase;\n  letter-spacing:.07em; color:#aaa; padding:.5rem .7rem;\n  border-bottom:2px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);\n}\n.tarifa-tabla td {\n  padding:.7rem .7rem; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--oscuro);\n  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.05); vertical-align:middle;\n}\n.tarifa-tabla tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }\n.tarifa-tabla tr:hover td { background:rgba(240,138,124,.04); transition:background .2s; }\n.t-precio { font-weight:800; color:var(--rosa-dark); white-space:nowrap; }\n.t-precio small { font-weight:400; font-size:.78rem; color:#aaa; }\n.tarifa-nota { margin-top:1rem; font-size:.87rem; color:#777; text-align:center; font-style:italic; }\n.tarifa-sep { border:none; border-top:1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,.12); margin:1.5rem 0; }\n@media(max-width:600px) {\n  .tarifa-tabla th:last-child,.tarifa-tabla td:last-child { display:none; }\n}\n\n/* ── POR QUÉ NOSOTROS ── */\n.porq-bg {\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,var(--gris) 100%);\n}\n.porq-grid {\n  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1.6rem;\n}\n.porq-item {\n  background:white; border-radius:24px;\n  padding:2rem 1.8rem 1.8rem;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n  border:1.5px solid #f0eeee;\n  transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1), box-shadow .35s, border-color .35s;\n  position:relative; overflow:hidden;\n}\n.porq-item::after {\n  content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:3px;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--rosa),var(--rosa-dark));\n  border-radius:24px 24px 0 0;\n}\n.porq-item:nth-child(even)::after {\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--verde),var(--verde-dark));\n}\n.porq-item:hover {\n  transform:translateY(-10px) scale(1.01);\n  box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(240,138,124,.2);\n  border-color:rgba(240,138,124,.25);\n}\n.porq-item:nth-child(even):hover {\n  box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(126,200,164,.22);\n  border-color:rgba(126,200,164,.28);\n}\n.porq-num {\n  position:absolute; top:1.1rem; right:1.3rem;\n  font-size:.65rem; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.14em;\n  color:rgba(0,0,0,.09);\n}\n.porq-ico-wrap {\n  width:68px; height:68px; border-radius:18px;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  font-size:2.1rem; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--rosa-light),rgba(240,138,124,.18));\n  box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(240,138,124,.2);\n  transition:transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;\n}\n.porq-item:nth-child(even) .porq-ico-wrap {\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--verde-light),rgba(126,200,164,.18));\n  box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(126,200,164,.2);\n}\n.porq-item:hover .porq-ico-wrap {\n  transform:scale(1.1) rotate(-4deg);\n  box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(240,138,124,.35);\n}\n.porq-item:nth-child(even):hover .porq-ico-wrap {\n  box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(126,200,164,.35);\n}\n.porq-item h3 { font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:900; color:var(--oscuro); margin-bottom:.5rem; }\n.porq-item p  { font-size:.88rem; color:#777; line-height:1.7; }\n@media(max-width:768px) { .porq-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }\n@media(max-width:480px) { .porq-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }\n\n/* ── GALERÍA ── */\n.galeria-bg { background:var(--gris); }\n.galeria-grid {\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);\n  grid-template-rows:220px 220px 220px;\n  gap:1rem;\n}\n.galeria-item {\n  border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;\n  background:#ddd; cursor:pointer;\n  position:relative;\n}\n.galeria-item:first-child { grid-column:1/3; grid-row:1/3; }\n.galeria-item:nth-child(4) { grid-column:3/5; }\n.galeria-item img {\n  width:100%; height:100%;\n  object-fit:cover; transition:.45s ease;\n  display:block;\n}\n.galeria-item:hover img { transform:scale(1.07); }\n/* Hover overlay */\n.galeria-caption {\n  position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0;\n  background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.72) 0%,transparent 100%);\n  color:white; padding:1.4rem 1rem .75rem;\n  font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700;\n  transform:translateY(100%); transition:transform .32s ease;\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.galeria-item:hover .galeria-caption { transform:translateY(0); }\n.galeria-zoom {\n  position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%;\n  transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(0);\n  width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:50%;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  font-size:1.2rem; transition:transform .28s ease;\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.galeria-item:hover .galeria-zoom { transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1); }\n\n/* Botón Instagram */\n.galeria-ig { margin-top:2rem; text-align:center; }\n.btn-ig {\n  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.7rem;\n  background:linear-gradient(45deg,#f09433,#e6683c,#dc2743,#cc2366,#bc1888);\n  color:white; text-decoration:none; font-weight:800; font-size:.95rem;\n  padding:.85rem 2rem; border-radius:50px;\n  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(220,39,67,.38);\n  transition:transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;\n}\n.btn-ig:hover { transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(220,39,67,.55); }\n\n/* Lightbox */\n.lb-overlay {\n  position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:10000;\n  background:rgba(0,0,0,.93); backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\n  display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n}\n.lb-overlay.open { display:flex; }\n.lb-overlay img {\n  max-width:90vw; max-height:85vh;\n  border-radius:12px; object-fit:contain;\n  box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.6);\n  user-select:none;\n}\n.lb-close {\n  position:absolute; top:1.2rem; right:1.2rem;\n  width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.15); border:none;\n  color:white; font-size:1.3rem; cursor:pointer;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  transition:background .2s; z-index:1;\n}\n.lb-close:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.3); }\n.lb-prev, .lb-next {\n  position:absolute; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%);\n  width:50px; height:50px; border-radius:50%;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.25); border:none;\n  color:white; font-size:1.5rem; cursor:pointer;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  transition:background .2s; z-index:1;\n}\n.lb-prev { left:1rem; }\n.lb-next { right:1rem; }\n.lb-prev:hover, .lb-next:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.4); }\n.lb-counter {\n  position:absolute; bottom:1.2rem; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);\n  color:rgba(255,255,255,.65); font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.1em;\n}\n\n/* ── BANNER JUNIO ── */\n.junio-banner {\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed 0%,#db2777 50%,#f59e0b 100%);\n  border-radius:20px; padding:28px 24px 22px; margin-bottom:36px;\n  text-align:center; color:#fff;\n  box-shadow:0 8px 36px rgba(124,58,237,.35);\n  position:relative; overflow:hidden;\n}\n.junio-banner::before {\n  content:'🔥'; position:absolute; top:-10px; right:18px;\n  font-size:5rem; opacity:.12; line-height:1;\n}\n.junio-tag {\n  display:inline-block; background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);\n  border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);\n  font-size:.72rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em;\n  text-transform:uppercase; padding:5px 16px; border-radius:30px;\n  margin-bottom:12px; backdrop-filter:blur(4px);\n}\n.junio-title {\n  font-size:clamp(1.25rem,4vw,1.9rem); font-weight:900;\n  margin-bottom:6px; text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.2);\n  line-height:1.2;\n}\n.junio-sub {\n  font-size:.9rem; font-weight:500; opacity:.88; margin-bottom:20px;\n}\n.junio-precios {\n  display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:22px;\n}\n.jp-item {\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.15); border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);\n  border-radius:14px; padding:10px 16px; backdrop-filter:blur(6px);\n  min-width:110px;\n}\n.jp-label { font-size:.72rem; font-weight:600; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:4px; }\n.jp-price { font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:900; line-height:1; }\n.junio-countdown {\n  display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center;\n  gap:6px; margin-bottom:20px;\n}\n.jc-block {\n  background:rgba(0,0,0,.25); border-radius:10px; padding:8px 12px;\n  min-width:56px;\n}\n.jc-block span { display:block; font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:900; line-height:1; }\n.jc-block small { display:block; font-size:.62rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:.8; margin-top:2px; }\n.jc-sep { font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:900; opacity:.6; margin-bottom:14px; }\n.junio-cta-btn {\n  display:inline-block; background:#fff; color:#7c3aed;\n  font-weight:800; font-size:.95rem; padding:12px 28px;\n  border-radius:50px; text-decoration:none;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.2);\n  transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;\n}\n.junio-cta-btn:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.28); }\n@media(max-width:480px) {\n  .jp-item { min-width:calc(50% - 10px); }\n  .jc-block { min-width:44px; padding:6px 8px; }\n  .jc-block span { font-size:1.4rem; }\n}\n\n/* ── PRECIOS ── */\n#precios { overflow-x:hidden; }\n.precios-grid {\n  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));\n  gap:1.5rem; align-items:start; justify-content:center;\n}\n.precio-card {\n  background:white; border-radius:var(--radio);\n  padding:2.5rem 2rem; text-align:center; cursor:pointer;\n  box-shadow:var(--sombra); position:relative;\n  transition:transform .35s, box-shadow .35s, background .35s, color .35s;\n}\n.precio-card:hover { transform:translateY(-6px); box-shadow:var(--sombra-hover); }\n.precio-card.selected {\n  background:linear-gradient(145deg, var(--verde-dark), var(--verde));\n  transform:scale(1.05) translateY(-4px);\n  box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(90,168,130,.35);\n}\n.precio-card.selected h3,\n.precio-card.selected .precio-num { color:white; }\n.precio-card.selected .precio-por { color:rgba(255,255,255,.8); }\n.precio-card.selected .precio-divider { background:rgba(255,255,255,.2); }\n.precio-card.selected .precio-lista li { color:rgba(255,255,255,.9); }\n.precio-card.selected .precio-lista li::before { color:white; }\n.precio-card.selected .precio-cta { background:white; color:var(--verde-dark); }\n.precio-card.selected:hover { transform:scale(1.05) translateY(-8px); }\n.precio-card.destacado {\n  background:linear-gradient(145deg, var(--rosa-dark), var(--rosa));\n  color:white; transform:scale(1.05);\n}\n.precio-card.destacado:hover { transform:scale(1.05) translateY(-6px); }\n.precio-badge {\n  position:absolute; top:-14px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);\n  background:var(--verde); color:white;\n  padding:.3rem 1.2rem; border-radius:50px;\n  font-size:.8rem; font-weight:800; white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.precio-icon { font-size:2.5rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }\n.precio-card h3 { font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:1rem; color:var(--oscuro); }\n.precio-card.destacado h3 { color:white; }\n.precio-num {\n  font-size:3.2rem; font-weight:900; color:var(--rosa-dark);\n  line-height:1;\n}\n.precio-card.destacado .precio-num { color:white; }\n.precio-num span { font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; }\n.precio-por { font-size:.85rem; color:#888; margin-top:.3rem; font-weight:600; }\n.precio-card.destacado .precio-por { color:rgba(255,255,255,.8); }\n.precio-divider {\n  height:1px; background:#eee; margin:1.5rem 0;\n}\n.precio-card.destacado .precio-divider { background:rgba(255,255,255,.2); }\n.precio-lista { list-style:none; font-size:.9rem; color:#666; }\n.precio-lista li { padding:.35rem 0; }\n.precio-card.destacado .precio-lista li { color:rgba(255,255,255,.9); }\n.precio-lista li::before { content:\"✓ \"; color:var(--verde); font-weight:800; }\n.precio-card.destacado .precio-lista li::before { color:white; }\n.precio-cta {\n  display:block; margin-top:1.8rem;\n  padding:.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius:50px;\n  text-decoration:none; font-weight:800; font-size:.95rem;\n  transition:.25s;\n}\n.precio-cta-normal {\n  background:var(--rosa-light); color:var(--rosa-dark);\n}\n.precio-cta-normal:hover { background:var(--rosa); color:white; }\n.precio-cta-destacado {\n  background:white; color:var(--rosa-dark);\n}\n.precio-cta-destacado:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.85); }\n\n/* ── TESTIMONIOS ── */\n.testimonios-bg { background:var(--verde-light); }\n.testimonios-grid {\n  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1.5rem;\n}\n.testimonio {\n  background:white; border-radius:var(--radio);\n  padding:2rem; box-shadow:var(--sombra);\n}\n.estrellas { color:#FFB400; font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:.8rem; }\n.testimonio p {\n  font-size:.98rem; color:#555;\n  line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\n  font-style:italic;\n}\n.testimonio-autor {\n  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.8rem;\n}\n.autor-avatar {\n  width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:50%;\n  overflow:hidden; flex-shrink:0;\n  box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.12);\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  font-weight:800; font-size:.95rem; color:white; letter-spacing:.01em;\n}\n.autor-avatar img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }\n.av-mg { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--rosa-dark),var(--rosa)); }\n.av-cr { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--verde-dark),var(--verde)); }\n.av-lp { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--oscuro),#3d5a74); }\n.autor-nombre { font-weight:800; font-size:.95rem; color:var(--oscuro); }\n.autor-perro { font-size:.82rem; color:#999; }\n\n/* ── CONTACTO + MAPA ── */\n.contacto-bg {\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rosa-dark) 0%, var(--rosa) 45%, #f0b89a 100%);\n  color:white;\n}\n.contacto-bg h2 { color:white; }\n.contacto-top { text-align:center; margin-bottom:3rem; }\n.contacto-top p { color:rgba(255,255,255,.8); max-width:500px; margin:.5rem auto 0; font-size:1.05rem; }\n.contacto-main {\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;\n  gap:2.5rem;\n  align-items:start;\n}\n/* Columna izquierda: formulario */\n.formulario {\n  background:white; border-radius:var(--radio);\n  padding:2.5rem; box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,.25);\n}\n.formulario h3 {\n  font-size:1.3rem; color:var(--oscuro);\n  margin-bottom:1.5rem; padding-bottom:.8rem;\n  border-bottom:2px solid var(--rosa-light);\n  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem;\n}\n.form-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1rem; }\n.form-group { margin-bottom:1rem; }\n.form-group label {\n  display:block; font-size:.82rem; font-weight:800;\n  color:var(--oscuro); margin-bottom:.35rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;\n}\n.form-group input,\n.form-group textarea,\n.form-group select {\n  width:100%; padding:.85rem 1rem; border-radius:12px;\n  border:1.5px solid #eee; font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;\n  font-size:.95rem; color:var(--texto); outline:none;\n  transition:border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;\n  background:#fafafa;\n}\n.form-group input:focus,\n.form-group textarea:focus,\n.form-group select:focus {\n  border-color:var(--rosa); background:white;\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(240,138,124,.15);\n}\n.form-group textarea { resize:vertical; min-height:90px; }\n.btn-form {\n  width:100%; padding:1rem; border:none;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--rosa-dark),var(--rosa));\n  color:white; font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;\n  font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:800; border-radius:50px;\n  cursor:pointer; transition:.3s; margin-top:.5rem;\n  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(240,138,124,.4);\n  letter-spacing:.02em;\n}\n.btn-form:hover { transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(240,138,124,.55); }\n\n/* Columna derecha: mapa + info */\n.contacto-derecha { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.5rem; }\n.mapa-wrapper {\n  border-radius:var(--radio); overflow:hidden;\n  box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.3);\n  height:280px; flex-shrink:0;\n}\n.mapa-wrapper iframe { width:100%; height:100%; border:none; display:block; }\n.info-cards { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.8rem; }\n.info-card {\n  display:flex; gap:1rem; align-items:center;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);\n  border-radius:16px; padding:1rem 1.2rem;\n  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);\n  transition:background .2s;\n}\n.info-card:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.35); }\n.info-ico {\n  width:42px; height:42px; min-width:42px; border-radius:12px;\n  background:var(--rosa); display:flex; align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center; font-size:1.1rem;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(240,138,124,.4);\n}\n.info-card strong { display:block; font-size:.78rem; opacity:.65; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n.info-card span { font-size:.95rem; font-weight:700; }\n.info-card a { color:white; text-decoration:none; }\n.wa-btn-grande {\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:.8rem;\n  background:#25D366; color:white; text-decoration:none;\n  padding:1rem 1.5rem; border-radius:16px; font-weight:800; font-size:1rem;\n  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(37,211,102,.35);\n  transition:background .3s, transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;\n  margin-top:.3rem;\n}\n.wa-btn-grande:hover { background:#1db954; transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(37,211,102,.5); }\n\n/* ── FOOTER ── */\nfooter {\n  background:var(--oscuro); color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);\n  padding:3.5rem 2rem 2rem;\n}\n.footer-inner {\n  max-width:1200px; margin:auto;\n  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr;\n  gap:3rem; margin-bottom:3rem;\n}\n.footer-brand .logo { color:white; margin-bottom:1rem; }\n.footer-brand p { font-size:.9rem; line-height:1.8; max-width:280px; }\n.footer-col h4 {\n  color:white; font-size:1rem; font-weight:800;\n  margin-bottom:1.2rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em;\n}\n.footer-col a {\n  display:block; color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);\n  text-decoration:none; font-size:.9rem;\n  margin-bottom:.6rem; transition:color .2s;\n}\n.footer-col a:hover { color:var(--rosa); }\n.footer-bottom {\n  max-width:1200px; margin:auto;\n  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);\n  padding-top:1.5rem;\n  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\n  font-size:.85rem;\n}\n\n/* ── SOCIAL HEADER ── */\n.nav-social { display:flex; gap:.5rem; align-items:center; }\n.nav-social a {\n  width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.15); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  transition:background .25s, border-color .25s, transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;\n  backdrop-filter:blur(6px); text-decoration:none;\n}\n.nav-social a::after { display:none !important; }\n.nav-social a:hover { background:var(--rosa); border-color:var(--rosa); transform:translateY(-2px); }\n/* Los 3 iconos (IG, Gmail, TK) usan el mismo fondo base — rojo/gradiente/negro solo en hover */\n.nav-social svg { width:15px; height:15px; fill:white; }\nheader.scrolled .nav-social a { background:rgba(0,0,0,.07); border-color:rgba(0,0,0,.12); }\nheader.scrolled .nav-social svg { fill:var(--oscuro); }\nheader.scrolled .nav-social a.ig:hover { background:linear-gradient(45deg,#f09433,#e6683c,#dc2743,#cc2366,#bc1888); border-color:transparent; }\nheader.scrolled .nav-social a.gm:hover { background:#EA4335; border-color:#EA4335; }\nheader.scrolled .nav-social a.tk:hover { background:#010101; border-color:#010101; }\nheader.scrolled .nav-social a:hover svg { fill:white; }\n/* Cuando el menú móvil está abierto, eliminar backdrop-filter para que el nav.open\n   pueda cubrir toda la pantalla con position:fixed (backdrop-filter crea containing block) */\nheader.menu-open,\nheader.menu-open.scrolled {\n  backdrop-filter: none !important;\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;\n}\n@media(max-width:768px) { .nav-social { display:none; } }\n\n/* ── SOCIAL FOOTER ── */\n.footer-social { display:flex; gap:.7rem; margin-top:1.2rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n.footer-social a {\n  width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:14px;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  transition:transform .3s, filter .3s, box-shadow .3s;\n  text-decoration:none; border:none;\n}\n.footer-social a svg { width:20px; height:20px; fill:white; transition:fill .3s; }\n.footer-social a:hover { transform:translateY(-5px) scale(1.08); filter:brightness(1.15); }\n/* Brand colors siempre visibles */\n.footer-social a.ig {\n  background:linear-gradient(45deg,#f09433,#e6683c,#dc2743,#cc2366,#bc1888);\n  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(220,39,67,.35);\n}\n.footer-social a.wa {\n  background:#25D366;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(37,211,102,.35);\n}\n.footer-social a.gm {\n  background:white;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(234,67,53,.25);\n}\n.footer-social a.tk {\n  background:#010101;\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\n  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.4);\n}\n.footer-social a.yt {\n  background:#FF0000;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(255,0,0,.35);\n}\n.footer-social a.ig:hover { box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(220,39,67,.6); }\n.footer-social a.wa:hover { box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(37,211,102,.6); }\n.footer-social a.gm:hover { box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(234,67,53,.45); }\n.footer-social a.tk:hover { box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(105,201,229,.4); }\n.footer-social a.yt:hover { box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(255,0,0,.6); }\n\n/* ── WHATSAPP BUBBLE ── */\n.wa-bubble {\n  position:fixed; bottom:7rem; right:2rem; z-index:9998;\n  background:white; border-radius:14px;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.16);\n  padding:.7rem 2rem .7rem .9rem;\n  max-width:210px; cursor:pointer;\n  opacity:0; transform:scale(.88) translateY(8px);\n  transition:opacity .3s, transform .3s;\n  pointer-events:none;\n  text-decoration:none; display:block;\n}\n.wa-bubble::after {\n  content:''; position:absolute;\n  bottom:-6px; right:24px;\n  border:6px solid transparent;\n  border-top-color:white; border-bottom:none;\n  filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.08));\n}\n.wa-bubble.show {\n  opacity:1; transform:scale(1) translateY(0);\n  pointer-events:all;\n}\n.wa-bubble-close {\n  position:absolute; top:.35rem; right:.45rem;\n  background:none; border:none; color:#bbb;\n  font-size:.8rem; cursor:pointer; line-height:1;\n}\n.wa-bubble-close:hover { color:#666; }\n.wa-bubble-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; }\n.wa-dot {\n  width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%;\n  background:#25D366; flex-shrink:0;\n}\n.wa-bubble-text { font-size:.8rem; color:#222; line-height:1.45; }\n.wa-bubble-text strong { color:#075E54; }\n\n/* ── WHATSAPP ── */\n.wa-float {\n  position:fixed; bottom:2rem; right:2rem; z-index:9999;\n  width:62px; height:62px; border-radius:50%;\n  background:#25D366;\n  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n  text-decoration:none;\n  box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(37,211,102,.5);\n  animation:wapulse 2.5s infinite;\n  transition:transform .2s, background .2s;\n}\n.wa-float:hover { transform:scale(1.1); background:#1ebe5d; }\n.wa-float svg { width:34px; height:34px; fill:white; }\n@keyframes wapulse {\n  0%   { box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(37,211,102,.5); }\n  70%  { box-shadow:0 0 0 18px rgba(37,211,102,0); }\n  100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(37,211,102,0); }\n}\n\n/* ── REVEAL ── */\n.reveal { opacity:0; transform:translateY(38px) scale(.97); transition:opacity .75s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), transform .75s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }\n.reveal.visible { opacity:1; transform:none; }\n\n/* Stagger para items dentro de grids */\n@keyframes childIn {\n  from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(28px) scale(.96); }\n  to   { opacity:1; transform:none; }\n}\n.reveal-child { animation:childIn .55s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both; }\n\n/* ── NAV MOBILE ENTRANCE ── */\n@keyframes navLinkIn {\n  from { opacity:0; transform:translateX(-22px); }\n  to   { opacity:1; transform:translateX(0); }\n}\n@keyframes navSocialIn {\n  from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px) scale(.92); }\n  to   { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0) scale(1); }\n}\n\n/* ── RESPONSIVE ── */\n@media(max-width:1024px) {\n  .precios-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; max-width:400px; margin:auto; }\n  .precio-card.destacado { transform:none; }\n  .precio-card.destacado:hover { transform:translateY(-6px); }\n  .galeria-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }\n  .galeria-item:first-child { grid-column:1/3; grid-row:auto; }\n  .galeria-item:nth-child(4) { grid-column:auto; }\n}\n@media(max-width:768px) {\n  nav { display:none; }\n  nav.open {\n    display:flex; flex-direction:column;\n    position:fixed; inset:0;\n    background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);\n    backdrop-filter:blur(48px) saturate(2.2) brightness(0.7);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(48px) saturate(2.2) brightness(0.7);\n    align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n    gap:1.6rem; z-index:999;\n  }\n  /* Entrada escalonada de cada enlace */\n  nav.open > a:nth-child(1) { animation:navLinkIn .38s .06s both; }\n  nav.open > a:nth-child(2) { animation:navLinkIn .38s .14s both; }\n  nav.open > a:nth-child(3) { animation:navLinkIn .38s .22s both; }\n  nav.open > a:nth-child(4) { animation:navLinkIn .38s .30s both; }\n  nav.open > a:nth-child(5) { animation:navLinkIn .38s .38s both; }\n  nav.open .nav-social      { animation:navSocialIn .42s .48s both; }\n  nav.open a {\n    font-size:1.55rem; color:white;\n    font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.02em;\n    position:relative; padding:.2rem 0;\n    text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.6);\n    transition:color .22s, transform .22s, letter-spacing .22s, text-shadow .22s;\n  }\n  nav.open a::after {\n    content:''; position:absolute;\n    bottom:0; left:0;\n    width:0; height:2px;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rosa), var(--verde));\n    border-radius:2px;\n    transition:width .3s ease;\n  }\n  nav.open a:hover { color:white; transform:translateX(10px); letter-spacing:.05em; text-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(240,138,124,.7); }\n  nav.open a:hover::after { width:100%; }\n  nav.open .nav-cta {\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rosa-dark), var(--rosa)) !important;\n    color:white !important;\n    padding:.75rem 2.4rem; border-radius:50px;\n    font-size:1.05rem; letter-spacing:.03em;\n    box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(240,138,124,.45);\n    transition:transform .25s, box-shadow .25s !important;\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-cta::after { display:none; }\n  nav.open .nav-cta:hover {\n    transform:translateY(-4px) translateX(0) !important;\n    box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(240,138,124,.65) !important;\n    letter-spacing:.03em !important;\n  }\n  /* Separador visual antes de los iconos */\n  nav.open .nav-social {\n    display:flex; gap:1.1rem; margin-top:.4rem;\n    padding-top:1.2rem;\n    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n    width:60%;\n    justify-content:center;\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-social a {\n    width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:16px;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n    font-size:initial; font-weight:initial; letter-spacing:initial;\n    transition:transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;\n    border:none;\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-social a::after { display:none !important; }\n  nav.open .nav-social a:hover { transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.1) !important; color:inherit; }\n  /* Instagram - gradiente oficial */\n  nav.open .nav-social a.ig {\n    background:linear-gradient(45deg,#f09433,#e6683c,#dc2743,#cc2366,#bc1888);\n    box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(220,39,67,.4);\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-social a.ig:hover { box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(220,39,67,.7) !important; }\n  /* WhatsApp - verde oficial */\n  nav.open .nav-social a.wa {\n    background:#25D366;\n    box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(37,211,102,.4);\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-social a.wa:hover { box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(37,211,102,.7) !important; }\n  /* Gmail - rojo oficial */\n  nav.open .nav-social a.gm {\n    background:#EA4335;\n    box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(234,67,53,.4);\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-social a.gm:hover { box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(234,67,53,.7) !important; }\n  /* TikTok - negro con toque cian */\n  nav.open .nav-social a.tk {\n    background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111,#1a1a2e);\n    border:1px solid rgba(105,201,229,.25);\n    box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.5), 0 0 0 0 rgba(105,201,229,0);\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-social a.tk:hover {\n    box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.6), 0 0 18px rgba(105,201,229,.35) !important;\n  }\n  nav.open .nav-social svg:not(.gmail-svg) { width:26px; height:26px; fill:white; }\n  nav.open .nav-social svg.gmail-svg { width:26px; height:26px; }\n  .nav-social { display:none; }\n  .menu-btn { display:block; z-index:1001; color:white; flex-shrink:0; }\n  header.scrolled .menu-btn { color:var(--oscuro); }\n  /* Header grid: [langBtn] [logo centrado] [menuBtn] */\n  .header-inner {\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:minmax(4.5rem,1fr) auto minmax(4.5rem,1fr);\n    grid-template-areas:'lang logo menu';\n    align-items:center;\n    padding-left:.8rem; padding-right:.8rem;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    position:static; transform:none;\n    grid-area:logo; justify-self:center;\n    font-size:1.15rem; white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  #langBtn { grid-area:lang; justify-self:start; font-size:.76rem; padding:.28rem .65rem; }\n  .menu-btn { grid-area:menu; justify-self:end; }\n  #langFlag { width:18px; height:13px; }\n  @media(max-width:360px) {\n    #langText { display:none; }\n    .logo { font-size:.9rem; }\n  }\n  .sobre-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }\n  .sobre-img { aspect-ratio:4/3; max-height:320px; }\n  .contacto-main { grid-template-columns:1fr; }\n  .mapa-wrapper { height:240px; }\n  .footer-inner { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:2rem; }\n  .footer-bottom { flex-direction:column; gap:.5rem; text-align:center; align-items:center; }\n  /* Cards de precios: quitar scale para evitar overflow horizontal */\n  .precio-card.destacado { transform:none; }\n  .precio-card.destacado:hover { transform:translateY(-6px); }\n  .precio-card.selected { transform:none; }\n  .precio-card.selected:hover { transform:translateY(-8px); }\n  .testimonios-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }\n  .form-row { grid-template-columns:1fr; }\n\n  /* Hero móvil */\n  .hero { align-items:center; min-height:100svh; }\n  .hero-content { padding:1rem 1.4rem; }\n  .hero-pill { font-size:.78rem; padding:.4rem 1rem; margin-bottom:.8rem; }\n  .hero h1 { font-size:2.4rem; margin-bottom:.5rem; }\n  .hero-guarderia-badge { margin:.4rem 0 .8rem; font-size:.72rem; }\n  .hero-tagline { display:none; }\n  .hero-desc { font-size:.9rem; margin-bottom:1.2rem; line-height:1.6; max-width:300px; }\n  .hero-btns { flex-direction:column; width:100%; max-width:260px; gap:.6rem; }\n  .btn { padding:.8rem 1.5rem; font-size:.95rem; text-align:center; }\n  .hero-stats { margin-top:1.4rem; gap:.7rem; }\n  .stat { padding:.65rem .9rem; min-width:78px; }\n  .stat-num { font-size:1.45rem; }\n  .stat-txt { font-size:.62rem; }\n}\n@media(max-width:560px) {\n  .galeria-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }\n  .galeria-item:first-child { grid-column:auto; }\n}\n\n/* ── BANNER KIT DIGITAL ── */\n.banner-kit {\n  background:#fff;\n  border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\n  padding:.7rem 2rem;\n  text-align:center;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n}\n.banner-kit-img {\n  display:inline-block;\n  max-width:100%;\n  height:auto;\n  vertical-align:middle;\n}\n@media(max-width:768px) {\n  .banner-kit { padding:.6rem 1rem; }\n}\n\n/* ── FOOTER EMBLEM ── */\n.footer-emblem {\n  display:inline-block; font-size:3.2rem; line-height:1;\n  text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:.6rem;\n  filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 14px rgba(240,138,124,.45));\n  transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), filter .35s;\n}\n.footer-emblem:hover {\n  transform:scale(1.18) rotate(-8deg);\n  filter:drop-shadow(0 6px 22px rgba(240,138,124,.7));\n}\n\n/* ── LANG BUTTON ── */\n.lang-btn {\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.15); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);\n  color:white; font-size:.78rem; font-weight:800;\n  padding:.35rem .85rem; border-radius:50px; cursor:pointer;\n  transition:background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s;\n  letter-spacing:.04em; backdrop-filter:blur(6px); flex-shrink:0;\n}\nheader.scrolled .lang-btn { background:rgba(0,0,0,.07); border-color:rgba(0,0,0,.12); color:var(--oscuro); }\n.lang-btn:hover { background:var(--rosa); border-color:var(--rosa); color:white !important; }\n@media(max-width:768px) { .lang-btn { font-size:.72rem; padding:.28rem .7rem; } }\n\n/* ── FOCUS VISIBLE ── */\n:focus-visible {\n  outline:2px solid var(--rosa);\n  outline-offset:3px;\n  border-radius:4px;\n}\n.form-group input:focus-visible,\n.form-group textarea:focus-visible,\n.form-group select:focus-visible {\n  outline:none;\n  border-color:var(--rosa);\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(240,138,124,.2);\n}\n.btn:focus-visible,\n.nav-cta:focus-visible,\n.btn-form:focus-visible {\n  outline:3px solid var(--rosa);\n  outline-offset:4px;\n}\n\n/* ── PREFERS REDUCED MOTION ── */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n  *,\n  *::before,\n  *::after {\n    animation-duration: .01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: .01ms !important;\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ── MODALES LEGALES ── */\n.modal-overlay {\n  display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:9999;\n  background:rgba(0,0,0,.6); backdrop-filter:blur(4px);\n  align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:1rem;\n}\n.modal-overlay.open { display:flex; }\n.modal-box {\n  background:white; border-radius:1rem; max-width:700px; width:100%;\n  max-height:85vh; overflow-y:auto; padding:2.5rem 2rem;\n  position:relative; box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3);\n}\n.modal-box h2 { font-family:'Pacifico',cursive; color:var(--rosa-dark); margin-bottom:1.2rem; font-size:1.6rem; }\n.modal-box h3 { color:var(--oscuro); margin:1.4rem 0 .5rem; font-size:1rem; }\n.modal-box p, .modal-box li { font-size:.93rem; line-height:1.75; color:#444; }\n.modal-box ul { padding-left:1.2rem; margin:.4rem 0; }\n.modal-close {\n  position:absolute; top:1rem; right:1rem;\n  background:none; border:none; font-size:1.4rem; cursor:pointer;\n  color:#999; line-height:1; padding:.3rem .5rem; border-radius:.5rem;\n  transition:background .2s;\n}\n.modal-close:hover { background:#f0f0f0; color:#333; }\n.footer-legal { display:flex; gap:1.2rem; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; }\n.footer-legal a { color:rgba(255,255,255,.55); font-size:.78rem; text-decoration:none; transition:color .2s; }\n.footer-legal a:hover { color:white; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- HEADER -->\n<header id=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"header-inner\">\n    <a href=\"#inicio\" class=\"logo\">🐾 La casita de <span>Simba</span></a>\n    <nav id=\"nav\">\n      <a href=\"#simba\">Sobre Simba</a>\n      <a href=\"#servicios\">Servicios</a>\n      <a href=\"#galeria\">Galería</a>\n      <a href=\"#precios\">Tarifas</a>\n      <a href=\"#contacto\" class=\"nav-cta\">Reservar plaza</a>\n      <div class=\"nav-social\">\n        <a href=\"https://instagram.com/lacasitadesimba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ig\" aria-label=\"Instagram\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"mailto:lacasitadesimba04@gmail.com\" class=\"gm\" aria-label=\"Gmail\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M24 5.457v13.909c0 .904-.732 1.636-1.636 1.636h-3.819V11.73L12 16.64l-6.545-4.91v9.273H1.636A1.636 1.636 0 010 19.366V5.457c0-2.023 2.309-3.178 3.927-1.964L12 9.641l8.073-6.148C21.69 2.28 24 3.434 24 5.457z\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://tiktok.com/@la_casita_de_simba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tk\" aria-label=\"TikTok\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 01-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 01-2.88 2.5 2.89 2.89 0 01-2.89-2.89 2.89 2.89 0 012.89-2.89c.28 0 .54.04.79.1V9.01a6.27 6.27 0 00-.79-.05 6.34 6.34 0 00-6.34 6.34 6.34 6.34 0 006.34 6.34 6.34 6.34 0 006.33-6.34V8.69a8.18 8.18 0 004.78 1.52V6.78a4.85 4.85 0 01-1.01-.09z\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n    <button id=\"langBtn\" class=\"lang-btn\" aria-label=\"Switch language\">\n      <img id=\"langFlag\" src=\"https://flagcdn.com/20x15/gb.png\" alt=\"EN\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" style=\"border-radius:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:3px;\">\n      <span id=\"langText\">EN</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"menu-btn\" id=\"menuBtn\" aria-label=\"Menú\">☰</button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"inicio\">\n\n  <div class=\"hero-slides\" id=\"heroSlides\">\n    <div class=\"hero-slide active\" style=\"background-image:url('images/2e7980f1-bc5b-4599-9af2-34098b615c14.JPG')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('images/30d8a9ff-adbf-413f-9ae9-d17d70abc661.JPG')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('images/6f7cf4c6-f635-4e8c-99d9-3a926a43727d.JPG')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('images/ac5dfbb4-fcc0-4b49-94c8-1493f78121f9.JPG')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('images/b0cb66bb-7b9a-4781-be74-6733ee17456b.JPG')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('images/a03634cc-ce55-46ee-b909-e5b249bbca59.JPG')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('images/f0524e71-6946-48c0-b2aa-fc49e63288c7.JPG')\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n  <div class=\"patas-wrap\" id=\"patasWrap\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-content\">\n    <div class=\"hero-pill\">🏅 Guarderia Canina Diurna · Madrid</div>\n    <h1>La casita de Simba</h1>\n    <div class=\"hero-guarderia-badge\">🐾 Donde tu perro es el rey</div>\n    <p class=\"hero-tagline\"><strong>Cuidado, juego y cariño como en casa</strong></p>\n    <p class=\"hero-desc\">Un hogar lleno de amor donde tu peludo se siente feliz, acompañado y seguro mientras estás trabajando o realizando otras actividades.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-btns\">\n      <a href=\"#contacto\" class=\"btn btn-rosa\">🐶 Reservar plaza</a>\n      <a href=\"#servicios\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">Ver servicios</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-stats\">\n      <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat-num\">+50</span><span class=\"stat-txt\">Perritos felices</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat-num\">5★</span><span class=\"stat-txt\">Valoración media</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat-num\">+10</span><span class=\"stat-txt\">Fotos al día</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n<!-- SOBRE SIMBA -->\n<section id=\"simba\" class=\"sobre-bg\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sobre-grid\">\n      <div class=\"sobre-img reveal\">\n        <img src=\"images/simbaperfil.JPG\" alt=\"Simba, el anfitrión de La Casita\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sobre-texto reveal\">\n        <div class=\"section-label label-rosa\">El anfitrión</div>\n        <h2>🐾 Hola, soy Simba 🐾</h2>\n        <p>Sí… ese de la foto. Un peludo arrugadito, gordito, tranquilo, y muy amoroso... Y hoy quiero contarte algo muy especial…</p>\n        <p>Hace un tiempo, mi mamá humana pensó en todos esos perros que, como yo, necesitan algo más que un lugar donde quedarse cuando sus familias no están. Necesitamos cariño, compañía, juegos… sentirnos como en casa.</p>\n        <p><strong>Así nació La Casita de Simba 🏡✨</strong><br>Un lugar creado con amor, donde cada peludo es parte de la familia.</p>\n        <p>Aquí no hay jaulas ni prisas… hay siestas al sol ☀️, juegos con amigos 🐕🐕, mimos infinitos 💛 y hasta celebraciones de cumpleaños 🎂 (¡sí, nos encanta soplar velitas aunque no sepamos hacerlo!).</p>\n        <ul class=\"checks\">\n          <li><span class=\"check-icon\">🐾</span>Cuidamos de ti como si fueras único (porque lo eres)</li>\n          <li><span class=\"check-icon\">🐾</span>Jugamos, socializamos y aprendemos juntos</li>\n          <li><span class=\"check-icon\">🐾</span>Respetamos tu ritmo y tu personalidad</li>\n          <li><span class=\"check-icon\">🐾</span>Y, sobre todo… te damos muchísimo cariño</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Yo mismo me encargo de supervisar que todo esté perfecto… bueno, cuando no estoy durmiendo 😴</p>\n        <p>Si estás buscando un lugar donde tu humano pueda dejarte tranquilo, feliz y bien cuidado…<br><strong>✨ te estoy esperando con las patitas abiertas ✨</strong></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SERVICIOS -->\n<section id=\"servicios\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <div class=\"section-label label-verde\">Lo que ofrecemos</div>\n      <h2>Servicios Premium 🐾</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">Todo lo que tu perro necesita para pasar el mejor día de su vida mientras tú tranquilamente trabajas o realizas otras actividades.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"servicios-grid reveal\">\n      <div class=\"servicio-card rosa\">\n        <div class=\"servicio-icon\">🐶</div>\n        <h3>Estancia Diurna</h3>\n        <p>Tu perro disfrutará del día jugando, socializando y recibiendo atención personalizada. Recogida y entrega a domicilio disponible (consulta disponibilidad).</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"servicio-card verde\">\n        <div class=\"servicio-icon\">🎂</div>\n        <h3>Cumpleaños Perrunos</h3>\n        <p>Celebraciones especiales con decoración, tarta y fotos. ¡Porque tu peludo también merece su fiesta!</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"servicio-card rosa\">\n        <div class=\"servicio-icon\">🗓️</div>\n        <h3>Bono Semanal</h3>\n        <p>Elige los días que necesitas de cada semana y paga solo por lo que usas. Perfecto para rutinas variables y agendas cambiantes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"servicio-card verde\">\n        <div class=\"servicio-icon\">🎟️</div>\n        <h3>Bono Mensual</h3>\n        <p>La opción más económica para clientes habituales. Precio especial al contratar el mes completo. Cuéntanos tu rutina y lo diseñamos a tu medida.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"servicio-rutina reveal\">\n      🔄 <strong>Nos adaptamos a tu rutina.</strong> Dinos tus horarios y diseñamos el servicio perfecto para ti y tu peludo — sin estrés y sin complicaciones.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- GALERÍA -->\n<section id=\"galeria\" class=\"galeria-bg\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <div class=\"section-label label-rosa\">Un día en La Casita</div>\n      <h2>Así de bien lo pasan 📸</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">Imágenes reales de nuestros peludos disfrutando en La Casita de Simba.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=